==English==
{{wikipedia|Rincon (meadow)}}

===Etymology===
Loaned from {{bor|en|es|rincón}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|rincons|rincones}}

# {{lb|en|US|southwestern US}} A [[meadow]] on the south-facing upper slopes of a [[mountain]].
# {{lb|en|US|southwestern US}} An abandoned [[meander]].
# {{lb|en|US|southwestern US}} An interior corner; a nook; hence, an angular recess or hollow bend in a mountain, river, cliff, etc.

